Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.00,0:00:09.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Aria-chan said she was at\Nthe Cinderella Stars event, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.33,0:00:14.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, I feel like I would've remembered\Nsomeone as gorgeous as her walking around.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.67,0:00:19.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and no one was talking about\Nanyone else besides you two.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.63,0:00:21.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe we were in the wrong\Nspot to hear about her?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.54,0:00:23.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry 'bout the wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.13,0:00:23.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was fast!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.75,0:00:27.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ta-dah!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.92,0:00:32.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who're you?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.04,0:00:35.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh... I'm from Princess Chanel?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.04,0:00:36.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Think her name's Pearl?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.42,0:00:37.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's "Princess Channel"!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.79,0:00:39.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,And how are you Pearl-chan?!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.75,0:00:41.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everything's wrong!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.25,0:00:43.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,The hair, the colors, the outfit,\Nand you didn't change your makeup!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.83,0:00:45.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?! How is it wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.88,0:00:48.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought she had a blonde ponytail\Nand a black bikini-type thing?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.38,0:00:50.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pearl-chan isn't blonde!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.29,0:00:53.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Her whole personality is based around\Nhow much she hates her red hair!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.00,0:00:53.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, really?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.96,0:00:56.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about her,\NI just know the anime's real popular.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.13,0:00:57.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplaying popular characters
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.83,0:00:59.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,is how you get famous, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.83,0:00:59.33,Q3,,0,0,0,,She doesn't have a ponytail!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.33,0:01:01.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can't even call this cosplay!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.42,0:01:05.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I take back all those heartfelt things I said!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.79,0:01:06.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You agree, right, Riri...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.54,0:01:11.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aria-chan...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.92,0:01:13.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah?!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.54,0:01:17.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your potential!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.67,0:01:18.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.33,0:01:22.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplay is so much more fun than this!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.04,0:03:00.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,She doesn't have a ponytail!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.29,0:03:02.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can't even call this cosplay!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.33,0:03:04.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I take back all those heartfelt things I said!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.04,0:03:06.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I take back all those heartfelt things I said!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.04,0:03:06.00,Q3,,0,0,0,,Maybe I shouldn't have dragged
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.00,0:03:08.13,Q3,,0,0,0,,a random stranger into their room...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.04,0:03:13.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplay's about taking a 2D design and\Nfinding a way to skillfully recreate it in 3D!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.58,0:03:16.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,When you wear your cosplay,\Nyou get in the groove with your favorite character!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.08,0:03:17.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,In the groove?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.13,0:03:18.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,After hours of hard work,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.88,0:03:21.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,when you make other fans\Nsuper happy to see you...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.29,0:03:22.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's utter bliss!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.92,0:03:23.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.33,0:03:26.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're a diamond in the rough, Aria-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.29,0:03:29.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,With your looks,\Nyou can be any character you want!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.54,0:03:32.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You have a world of endless possibilities!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.58,0:03:38.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, Aria-chan... Please, I beg of you...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.50,0:03:41.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Will you try cosplaying our way, just once?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.08,0:03:45.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I promise, you'll shine brighter than ever!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.63,0:03:56.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd love that!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.96,0:04:01.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,First, let's get you acquainted\Nwith a bunch of famous anime!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.83,0:04:04.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll also watch all the anime airing this season!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.38,0:04:06.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't those air way past midnight?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.42,0:04:09.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,How else are we going to get you\Nto go down the rabbit hole?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.38,0:04:10.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.04,0:04:13.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. You'll like it in the rabbit hole.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.29,0:04:14.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. You'll like it in the rabbit hole.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.29,0:04:14.54,Q3,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Nonoa.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.54,0:04:16.13,Q3,,0,0,0,,Once she gets started,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.13,0:04:17.67,Q3,,0,0,0,,she can't be stopped...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.00,0:04:19.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.46,0:04:22.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's probably why I like her so much, anyway.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.46,0:04:26.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You had the courage to go out and cosplay.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.08,0:04:29.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's enough to make you an ally.\NA friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.50,0:04:33.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Will you be my friend?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.75,0:04:36.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes! Of course I'll be your friend!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.79,0:04:39.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,She took me in as a friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.54,0:04:42.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've got no right to stop her\Ndoing that for someone else.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.29,0:04:45.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,And maybe if she starts liking otaku stuff, too...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.71,0:04:48.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can be friends with her,\Ndespite the gyaru thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.00,0:04:51.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll need your help too, Nono-pi!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.54,0:04:55.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop calling me that!\NAnd give me some personal space!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.75,0:04:59.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, it's gonna take time for me to get there.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.04,0:05:04.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Before you change,\Ncan I take a closer look at your costumes?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.42,0:05:06.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure, if it'll help you learn something!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.67,0:05:09.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,If Ririsa-chan is cool with it, I guess I am, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.00,0:05:10.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.17,0:05:13.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are these your real boobs?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.04,0:05:13.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.83,0:05:15.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can I touch them?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.04,0:05:16.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?! No!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.67,0:05:17.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go ahead!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.33,0:05:18.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.29,0:05:22.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't want people to touch me\Nand think it's just a costume.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.92,0:05:25.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want my costume to be so realistic\Nthat people think I'm really Liliel,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.63,0:05:27.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,even when they touch me!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.42,0:05:28.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, lemme try.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.92,0:05:31.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hands off!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.50,0:05:33.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?! But she said it was okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.00,0:05:34.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,To touch her costume!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.83,0:05:36.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-it's fine, really!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.58,0:05:39.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, you were just so cute,\NI couldn't help myself.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.29,0:05:41.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You wanna touch 'em too, don'tcha, Nono-pi?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.38,0:05:46.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Would you, uh, like to touch them?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.54,0:06:02.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,D-did they feel like Liliel's?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.92,0:06:04.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.13,0:06:07.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like marshmallows,\Nor meat buns, they're just...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.42,0:06:08.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Angelic.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.04,0:06:10.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Boobs can be angelic?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.54,0:06:12.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.71,0:06:19.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like, both of you have great figures.\NStraight out of a manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.50,0:06:21.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm all flat and angular.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.96,0:06:26.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,No way! You're so thin and slender,\Njust like an anime character!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.38,0:06:30.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm all short and stumpy and thick.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.29,0:06:34.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?! But that's so much more attractive!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.00,0:06:38.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I'm all muscle.\NI wish I looked more feminine.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.42,0:06:40.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, but you have the body of a model!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.92,0:06:45.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,But Ririsa's soft and curvy,\Nand you're slim and elegant.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.88,0:06:51.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The grass is greener on the other side, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.08,0:06:54.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no such thing as a perfect body...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.38,0:06:59.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,But with cosplay,\Nyou can change your figure however you want!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.33,0:07:01.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's one of the great things about cosplay!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.67,0:07:03.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.79,0:07:06.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't really think about my\Nfigure when I'm cosplaying.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.75,0:07:10.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry for interrupting your shoot today!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.58,0:07:12.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay! We still had a great time.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.08,0:07:16.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, you should come to our club sometime!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.38,0:07:18.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, really? I'm so there!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.96,0:07:22.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, girls!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.71,0:07:29.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Today, we're dragging Aria-chan down the\Nrabbit hole with our first anime viewing party!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.21,0:07:31.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.71,0:07:34.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the principal said this was okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.17,0:07:37.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I heard you got another cute cosplayer to join,\Nso I worked my magic on him!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.92,0:07:40.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I treated it like a "joint band rehearsal."
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.38,0:07:41.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are we a band now?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.04,0:07:46.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Amano-san is a national-level competitor, yes?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.96,0:07:50.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,It would be good for her to\Npractice with others at her level.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.63,0:07:53.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,We don't do competitions, though...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.50,0:07:56.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wish you the best of luck\Nat your summer tournament!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.00,0:07:58.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is he talking about Comiket?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.00,0:08:03.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd stick around,\Nbut I've got meetings today.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.83,0:08:05.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sensei!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.17,0:08:08.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's a newbie, right?\NGo easy on her.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.54,0:08:10.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we will!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.71,0:08:13.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,By the way, Ririsa-sensei,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.58,0:08:15.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,what's this "rabbit hole"\Nyou're gonna drag me into?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.33,0:08:16.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Am I about to get punked or something?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.92,0:08:19.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't be here if we were about to prank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.38,0:08:22.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, duh.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.92,0:08:26.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,The "rabbit hole" is the deep,\Ndark pit of otakudom.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.92,0:08:29.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Once you're hooked, you fall in.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.50,0:08:33.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,The more you watch,\Nthe deeper you go,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.67,0:08:35.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,until the light is blotted out by anime and manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.50,0:08:38.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, Geez!\NWhy'd you have to make it sound so scary?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.42,0:08:40.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,So what, is that darkness where you all live now?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.21,0:08:41.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.00,0:08:41.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeppers.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.54,0:08:42.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Should I be worried?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.21,0:08:47.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no right way to cosplay,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.00,0:08:50.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,but we want you to try doing it our way,\Njust once.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.29,0:08:54.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,To find a character you like,\Nand learn how fun cosplay can be!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.38,0:08:57.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,First, you'll watch a bunch\Nof different classics,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.67,0:09:00.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,then make a cosplay\Nof your favorite character...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.25,0:09:04.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You sure you're not just trying\Nto turn me into an otaku?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.00,0:09:05.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Without further ado,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.92,0:09:08.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,allow me to introduce you to\Nthe professor assisting us!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.63,0:09:12.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hi, there.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.58,0:09:15.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've picked out a selection to start with.\NCall me Professor Okumura.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.54,0:09:16.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I know you.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.21,0:09:18.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're Ririsa's boyfriend.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.13,0:09:22.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're not dating!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.46,0:09:23.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?! You're joking!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.29,0:09:28.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You guys totally act like a couple, though!\NI totally assumed you were together!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.54,0:09:30.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That thought didn't even pass through my head...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.79,0:09:35.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm only into 2D girls.\NI'd never date a 3D girl like her.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.79,0:09:38.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,No idea what that means,\Nbut now I know you're a real creep.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.63,0:09:44.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right, then!\NLet's start with one of the Liliel anime.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.08,0:09:51.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, if we wanted to watch all 312 episodes,\Nthat would take us four full days.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.00,0:09:54.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,312 episodes?!\NHoly crap, don't scare me like that!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.42,0:09:56.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's without eating or sleeping, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.58,0:10:02.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,There is an entire spinoff dedicated to Liliel,\Nwhich is practically our bible.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.50,0:10:05.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, would it be strange to start with the spinoff?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.50,0:10:09.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Allow me to give you my expert otaku opinion.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.13,0:10:13.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can start any series wherever you want!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.71,0:10:17.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Missed the first episode?\NYou can still watch the rest of the season!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.21,0:10:19.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't know the manga but think\Nthe cover for Volume 6 is sick? Buy it!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.71,0:10:22.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your favorite actor said they liked it?\NThat's a perfectly good reason to get into it!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.96,0:10:26.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Plus, the first season's only 13 episodes,\Nso we can watch it in four hours!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.29,0:10:28.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're gonna watch anime for four hours?!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.04,0:10:29.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's longer than most sports practices!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.92,0:10:31.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm giving you homework, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.00,0:10:32.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa, you're scaring me.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.25,0:10:33.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, once you get into it,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.75,0:10:36.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,you can spend your entire\Nsummer break watching anime
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.42,0:10:38.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,without remembering to eat or drink.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.59,0:10:40.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nono-pi, you're the worst one here.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.54,0:10:47.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,The action scene in the first episode is so good,\Nyou'll think it was made for a movie!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.92,0:10:51.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please enjoy the internationally-acclaimed\Nanimation work of master Nakamura.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.67,0:10:54.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,No idea what you're talking about,\Nbut I'm ready to go.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.88,0:11:03.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,LILIEL!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.21,0:11:08.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, no shouting at the screen!\NMovie theater rules, got it?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.38,0:11:10.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right. Sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.21,0:11:11.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.63,0:11:25.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,That last line of hers was foreshadowed\Nway back in the early episodes!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.71,0:11:26.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.58,0:11:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,She doesn't seem into it.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.29,0:11:33.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe this anime is too\Ntough for a gyaru to get into.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.71,0:11:35.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,We should've started with a romantic comedy.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.75,0:11:38.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's have faith in our beloved Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.25,0:11:39.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-you're right.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.63,0:11:44.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aria-chan...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.42,0:11:47.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is this boring you?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.38,0:11:49.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? No, it's good.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.04,0:11:50.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, really?!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.67,0:11:52.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just, I dunno...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.00,0:11:57.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've been sitting around for too long.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.04,0:11:59.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it make you wanna\Ngo outside and walk around?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:59.96,0:12:01.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go... Outside?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.88,0:12:05.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why would we go outside?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.13,0:12:06.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.58,0:12:09.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're acting like we're in a\Nzombie movie or something.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.88,0:12:11.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Aria-chan.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.00,0:12:15.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-if you can't make it through watching this,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.25,0:12:20.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,then there's no way you\Ncan learn anything from Ririsa.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.79,0:12:23.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is a piece of cake for me.\NI can do it!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.33,0:12:27.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love Ririsa's passion.\NI know she's got the right idea!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.88,0:12:32.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm dead set on cosplaying with you two!\NYou're awesome cosplayers!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.25,0:12:37.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's not even an otaku, though.\NWhy is she so dead set on this?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.42,0:12:39.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no going back! I'm doing this!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.46,0:12:42.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,All we're doing is watching some anime...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.00,0:12:46.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've got you now!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.71,0:12:54.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Get away from here.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.71,0:12:57.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll hold it back,\Neven if it costs my life...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.46,0:12:59.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.63,0:13:01.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You think we'd sacrifice you just to escape?!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.08,0:13:06.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, if we're going to die anyways,\Nwe may as well do it as a group.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.83,0:13:11.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's the end?\NHow can they end it there?!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.71,0:13:14.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Things were just getting intense!\NWhat happens next?!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.17,0:13:18.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.29,0:13:22.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Anything I say would be a spoiler!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.79,0:13:25.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to tell you so bad,\Nbut I can't say a single word!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.54,0:13:27.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.17,0:13:31.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.75,0:13:38.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,No! She can't...\NThis can't be happening!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.33,0:13:46.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,LILIEL!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.42,0:13:50.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was so good!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.08,0:13:52.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you liked it!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.21,0:13:55.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I never knew anime could\Nmake me cry like this!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.96,0:13:58.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm glad it resonated with you!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.17,0:14:00.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was worried a fantasy show\Nwould be too tough to get into.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.25,0:14:06.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nah, it kinda reminded me of a manga\NI read when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.04,0:14:08.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, good.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.00,0:14:10.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wonder what manga that was.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.08,0:14:15.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll watch some old classics\Nand new popular anime,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.75,0:14:17.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,so you can find a character you like!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.83,0:14:20.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sounds good!\NI wish every class was this fun, Sensei!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.75,0:14:22.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's so much fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.75,0:14:28.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get to see my friends every week,\Nand watch anime together...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.29,0:14:30.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, Nono-pi!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.46,0:14:33.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,We can hang out whenever you want.\NWe're friends, after all!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.25,0:14:38.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know what'll turn that frown upside down.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.17,0:14:39.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's go bowling,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.54,0:14:41.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,hit up an all-you-can-eat place,\Nthen finish it off with some karaoke!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.79,0:14:43.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to kill me?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.38,0:14:45.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's call it for today.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.88,0:14:47.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.38,0:14:50.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nono-pi, let's walk back together!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.04,0:14:51.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,We can hit up the stores by the station!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.33,0:14:53.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,How do you have this much energy?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.71,0:15:00.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't really get this one.\NNono-pi almost died laughing, though.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.04,0:15:03.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It might be a little too meta.\NIt's hard to get it if you're not already an otaku.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.33,0:15:06.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's stay away from\Nanything with too many inside jokes.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.21,0:15:09.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Penetrate!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.17,0:15:12.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was a fun anime!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.46,0:15:14.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, first time I've seen it, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.13,0:15:16.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura-senpai really knows how to pick them.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.58,0:15:17.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.79,0:15:20.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, you got me one, too?\NI've never had it before.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.54,0:15:22.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.67,0:15:32.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so full... My blood sugar is so high...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.88,0:15:34.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You barely took a baby sip!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.04,0:15:37.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-wait, what did I do this time?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.88,0:15:40.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You said this was a new anime?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.67,0:15:45.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,The art is more polished than older anime,\Nbut there's less animation overall.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.50,0:15:47.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,The plot was pretty interesting, though.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.79,0:15:51.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe she's already\Ndoing such in-depth analysis...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.04,0:15:54.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,All the old ones we've watched\Nwere masterpieces of their time,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.75,0:15:56.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,so you might be a little biased.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.00,0:15:57.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:57.79,0:16:00.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,And animation quality isn't everything.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.33,0:16:05.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Anime is all a product of its time,\Nand some older shows haven't aged that well.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.58,0:16:09.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, you should watch some older\Nanimation from Western studios.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.46,0:16:10.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's shockingly good.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.42,0:16:12.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've seen a lot of anime now.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.13,0:16:15.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Were there any shows or\Ncharacters that stood out to you?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.17,0:16:18.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're right, we've watched a lot...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.08,0:16:21.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, I think I liked the first\None we watched most of all.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.58,0:16:24.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's the one you guys are super into, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.63,0:16:26.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,All our hard work paid off!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.79,0:16:28.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd call that a win, Ririsa!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.25,0:16:29.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Totally!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.08,0:16:33.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Plus, then I'd get to do a cosplay\Ngroup with you guys, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.67,0:16:36.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah, we could.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.33,0:16:40.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,So which character would you wanna be?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.04,0:16:44.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa does Liliel, and Nono-pi does Nokiel,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.13,0:16:46.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,and they're both in the Angelic\NAirborne Defense Squadron, yeah?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.96,0:16:50.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you like Liliel,\Nthen you could cosplay her this time...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:50.63,0:16:52.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nah, I already know who I want to be...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.92,0:16:53.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Her.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.83,0:16:56.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ariel!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.00,0:16:57.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yup, Ariel!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.25,0:17:00.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,You'd make an awesome Ariel, Aria-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.50,0:17:01.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you pick her 'cause your names are the same?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.88,0:17:03.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,What? No!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.17,0:17:07.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just, like... I dunno how to put it.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.21,0:17:10.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,She looks a whole lot like me, don't you think?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.38,0:17:16.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's that, then!\NYou need an Ariel costume!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.25,0:17:18.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can make it by hand,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.67,0:17:22.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,or you can commission or\Nbuy an already-made one.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.46,0:17:25.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to make it!\NI won't stand out in anything else!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.88,0:17:29.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Got it! I'll help you do it!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.13,0:17:32.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,She cares so much about the most random things.\NIt's so confusing.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.13,0:17:34.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll show you the ropes,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.96,0:17:36.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,and we'll debut our group\Nat the next big event!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.92,0:17:38.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.42,0:17:45.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I had so much fun today.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.46,0:17:51.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Twenty cosplayers that didn't\Nmake the Rising Stars list..."
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.00,0:17:54.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that Aria-chan?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.96,0:17:58.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why'd she wear an obscure\Ncosplay to her first event?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.71,0:18:00.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,She doesn't know much about manga
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.50,0:18:03.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,and said she would do\Npopular characters to get famous.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.21,0:18:05.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Or did she make that all up?!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.92,0:18:07.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.92,0:18:12.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,A true diamond in the rough:\Nthis is apparently her first cosplay,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.38,0:18:14.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,and it very much shows.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.33,0:18:15.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I asked what series she was from,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.92,0:18:17.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,but had no idea what\Nit was until I looked it up.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.21,0:18:20.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why cosplay such an obscure character?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.33,0:18:26.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's Melia from VB, Valkyrie Battle.\NI haven't thought about that series in forever!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.08,0:18:29.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was in the first Jump magazine I ever bought,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.17,0:18:31.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,back in first grade,\Nlike ten years ago?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.79,0:18:33.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was before I got into Liliel.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.79,0:18:36.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa! That makes it pretty old, then.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:36.96,0:18:38.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was super into it for some reason.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.79,0:18:40.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I actually sent my first fan\Nletter to the VB mangaka.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.79,0:18:41.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.63,0:18:43.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I got a weird letter back.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.42,0:18:46.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, you got a letter back?!\NThat's extra cool!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.96,0:18:48.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your letter, Okumura-kun.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.75,0:18:56.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,But please don't tell your friends you like my manga.\NThey'll make fun of you.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.17,0:18:58.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.25,0:18:59.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Talk about worst case scenario.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.92,0:19:03.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wasn't online back then,\Nso I hadn't heard the rumors,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.21,0:19:08.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,but people were all saying the manga\Nwas a knockoff of the Ashford Chronicles.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.04,0:19:10.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It ended up getting canceled after just ten chapters.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.25,0:19:12.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,As a kid,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.50,0:19:16.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was confused how such an\Nawesome manga ended in just two volumes.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.17,0:19:21.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't blame him, though.\NThat would've been a lot to deal with.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.08,0:19:23.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I bought the volumes,\Nbut I haven't read them in a long time.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.79,0:19:26.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,It brings back too many bad memories.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.50,0:19:29.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure I brought them here at some point...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.50,0:19:30.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, here it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.67,0:19:34.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, then why was Aria-chan\Ncosplaying from that manga?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.00,0:19:37.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey hey, people!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.67,0:19:40.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, what're you guys up to?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.46,0:19:46.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why do you have a copy of VB?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.33,0:19:52.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's from my first event!\NI didn't know that guy was a big deal.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.50,0:19:57.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aria-chan, why'd you cosplay from\Nthis ancient, obscure manga?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:57.96,0:20:00.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Didn't you want to get famous?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.63,0:20:03.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seriously, there's so much about\Nyou that doesn't make sense!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.08,0:20:06.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could you tell us why you even\Nwant to cosplay so badly?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.96,0:20:09.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nah, that's kinda personal!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.83,0:20:12.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Says the person who's always\Nin our personal space!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.21,0:20:14.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now she doesn't want to get personal?!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:14.42,0:20:18.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was just starting to trust her, too!\NThis is why I hate gyaru...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.50,0:20:20.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, stop that.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.00,0:20:26.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe Aria-chan and I have some disconnect,\Njust like I did with Ririsa-chan at first.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.79,0:20:33.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I should hear her out.\NThen, I'll tell her how I feel.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.25,0:20:39.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aria-chan, why can't you tell us?\NIs it too hard to talk about?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.13,0:20:42.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not really, it's just kinda boring.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.08,0:20:45.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Boring?! But I want to hear it!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.17,0:20:49.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I feel like friends need to keep\Nsome distance between them, y'know?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.88,0:20:51.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I told you everything right off the bat,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.92,0:20:54.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,we'd get way too close,\Nlike family close,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.92,0:20:58.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,and we'd always be\Noversharing and asking for comfort.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.58,0:21:00.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's no fun for anyone.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.17,0:21:05.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Friends are people you should have fun with,\Nnot emotional punching bags, y'know?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.83,0:21:10.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hadn't thought of it that way.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.33,0:21:14.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aria-chan's got a lot\Nmore experience with friendship,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.38,0:21:17.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,and that's where she's coming from.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.21,0:21:20.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I heard her out.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.04,0:21:25.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, now I need to tell her what I think!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.50,0:21:30.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's what normal friends are like...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.04,0:21:33.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, I was raised on shonen manga,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.38,0:21:39.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,and they taught me that\Nfriends tell each other everything!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.83,0:21:42.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Their past, their feelings, their real selves!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.46,0:21:47.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to be friends with you, Aria-chan,\Nso I want to know why you want to cosplay!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.29,0:21:50.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,N-Nono-pi...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.88,0:21:52.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nonoa-chan...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.63,0:21:54.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You guys wanna know, too?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.29,0:21:56.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind telling us.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.21,0:22:01.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't mind, just... How do I say this?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.96,0:22:11.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,My dad's the author of this manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.50,0:22:15.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.63,0:22:17.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your dad's a manga-ka?!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.38,0:22:23.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's the author of Valkyrie Battle?!
